    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n12382" root="درج" body-key="d">
    
      7 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اندرجوا</span></b> : see 1. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اندرج</span> also signifies <i>It
was,</i> or <i>became, folded, folded up,</i> or <i>rolled up.</i>
(KL.) [And <i>It was,</i> or <i>became, infolded,</i> or <i>inwrapped.</i> ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  And hence, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اندرج فِيهِ</span> (assumed tropical:)  <i>It was,</i> or
<i>became, involved, implied,</i> or <i>included, in it.</i> ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4- 
And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اندرج تَحْتَ كَذَا</span> (assumed tropical:)  <i>It was,</i> or <i>became, classed
as a subordinate to such a thing.</i>]

